  "title": "How do I install Edge?",
  "description": "Edge can be installed on iOS or Android devices with iOS 13 or Android 9. \nYou can visit www.edge.app to find links to the store pages or ...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\">Edge can be installed on iOS or Android devices with iOS 13 or Android 9.</p><p class=\"no-margin\">You can visit <a href=\"http://www.edge.app\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">www.edge.app</a> to find links to the store pages or for Android users download the APK.</p><p class=\"no-margin\">Additionally you can use the following links:</p><p class=\"no-margin\">Android users click <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=co.edgesecure.app&amp;hl=en_US\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">here</a></p><p class=\"no-margin\">iOS users click <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/edge-bitcoin-wallet/id1344400091\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">here</a></p>",
